---
title: Safe Internet Research
---
flowchart TB
    Query([User query]) --> Need{Needs current<br/>web information?}
    Need -->|no| Local[Answer from local model<br/>and local context]
    Need -->|yes| Privacy{Can a safe public<br/>query be formed?}
    Privacy -->|no| Block[Explain why search<br/>was blocked]
    Privacy -->|yes| MCP[Read-only internet<br/>MCP tool]
    MCP --> Policy{Provider policy}

    Policy -->|primary when enabled| Google[Gemini 3.6 Flash<br/>with Google Search]
    Policy -->|fallback| Tavily[Tavily search]
    Google -. optional cross-check .-> Tavily

    Google --> Sources[Merge, bound and<br/>deduplicate sources]
    Tavily --> Sources
    Sources --> Context[Quoted untrusted<br/>research context]
    Context --> Inference[Provider-neutral<br/>inference adapter]
    Inference --> Main[Qwen 3.5 4B via vLLM<br/>cited answer]
    Main --> UI[Answer, sources,<br/>and visible search status]

    Quota[(Local daily Google quota)] -.-> Policy

    classDef interface fill:#f5f5f7,stroke:#86868b,color:#1d1d1f;
    classDef application fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#5e8fc4,color:#102a43;
    classDef data fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#5f9562,color:#183b1b;
    classDef external fill:#f1edff,stroke:#8872c6,color:#2e2450;
    classDef warning fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b78b20,color:#4d3900;
    class Query,Local,Block,UI interface;
    class Need,Privacy,MCP,Policy,Sources,Context,Inference application;
    class Quota data;
    class Google,Tavily,Main external;
